*.exe
*.zip

# Sensitive files
*.dat
*.save
*.log

# Licensed art: kept on disk, never committed (this repo is public).
# LimeZu Modern Exteriors / Modern Interiors / Character Generator output, and other third-party packs.
# The Forge-made character sheets (Chess_RPG_cyhippy.png) are original and stay tracked.
/Assets/Modern Exteriors/
/Assets/Tilemap/Modern_Exteriors_Complete_Tileset.png
/Assets/Interiors/
/World/Downtown/downtown_terrain.png
/World/Downtown/downtown_objects.png
/World/Downtown/previews/
/Assets/Sprites/Characters/Chess_RPG_*.png
!/Assets/Sprites/Characters/Chess_RPG_cyhippy.png
/_archive/Assets/Sprites/Pixel Crawler - Free Pack/
# Scale-test crops and previews cut from the licensed packs
/_archive/Assets/ScaleTest/
/_archive/Claude outputs/

# Large source data (re-downloadable from Lichess)
/Puzzles/lichess_db_puzzle.csv

# Junk
*.tmp
desktop.ini
